OL,3,GNEWSAAvanti West Coast services to be
OL,4,Anationalised from March
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvanti West Coast's managing director
OL,7,Fsaid he was "proud of what we've
OL,8,Fachieved over the last six years". The
OL,9,Fcompany's contract was due to come to
OL,10,Fan end on 7 March.
